  "overview": "**Feelix** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#0969da` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Mona Sans VF` (32px display down to 14px body), unified by `6px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **MYOB**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (http://feelix.myob.com/). Inventory: **91** colors, **16** typography steps, and **31** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 31 component tokens with documented paddings: `0`, `0 .75rem`, `8px 12px`, `6px 10px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#fff` cards; separate sibling sections using `#d1d9e0` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 1px 1px 0 #1f23280a,0 1px 2px 0 #1f232808`, `0 0 0 1px #d1d9e080,0 6px 12px -3px #25292e0a,0 6px 18px 0 #25292e1f`) paired with `#d1d9e0` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#0969da` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#0969da` with `#f7f7f8` text (4.8:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Mona Sans VF` headings with `Mona Sans VF` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `6px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (6px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#fff` surface shifts and `#d1d9e0` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `6px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `prc-components-Input-IwWrt` fields and secondary buttons."
}
